        "value": "Global Wealth & Fund Centre\nA preferred jurisdiction for private equity, investment funds, trusts, and wealth management structures\n"
      },
      {
        "id": 91,
        "value": "Flexible Business Structures\nSupports companies, protected cell companies (PCCs), incorporated cell companies (ICCs), foundations, and trusts\n"
      },
      {
        "id": 92,
        "value": "International Regulatory Standards\nMaintains strong compliance with OECD, FATF, and global transparency requirements\n"
      },
      {
        "id": 93,
        "value": "Stable Legal Framework\nOperates under English common law, providing legal certainty and investor confidence\n"
