        "id": 132,
        "question": "Why is Guernsey popular for international business?\n",
        "answer": "Guernsey offers tax efficiency, regulatory credibility, and a highly developed financial services ecosystem for international investors.\n"
      },
      {
        "id": 133,
        "question": "What types of companies can be formed in Guernsey?\n",
        "answer": "Businesses can establish companies, PCCs, ICCs, trusts, foundations, and other specialised investment structures.\n"
      },
      {
        "id": 134,
        "question": "Who regulates financial services in Guernsey?\n",
        "answer": "The Guernsey Financial Services Commission (GFSC) supervises financial institutions and investment businesses.\n"
      },
      {
        "id": 135,
        "question": "Does Guernsey follow international compliance standards?\n",
        "answer": "Yes, Guernsey aligns with OECD, FATF, and global transparency and anti-money laundering frameworks.\n"
      },
      {
        "id": 136,
        "question": "How long does company incorporation take?\n",
        "answer": "Most companies can be incorporated within 1 to 5 business days, subject to documentation.\n"
      }
